RDD: Resilient Distributed Dataset

RDD is the basic Fundamental data structure of Apache Spark
low level transformations - RDD


Resilient - Fault- Tolerant(can Recover using Lineage)
Distributed - Stored across multiple nodes in cluster
Dataset - collect of data

It is immutable distributed collection of objects can be processed in parallel across spark cluster


If I write Data frame it will be converted to RDD

